  "steps": [
    "Marinate paneer: Add salt, pepper, soy sauce, ginger garlic paste and 1 tsp flour to paneer. Mix well.",
    "Coat: Dip the paneer in slurry, then coat with crushed cornflakes.",
    "Cook: Air fry at 200°C for 5-7minutes with a light oil spray until crispy.",
    "Make sauce: Mix gochujang paste, chilli oil, a little honey (optional), lemon juice and spring onions.",
    "Toss & serve: Coat the crispy paneer in the sauce and serve with rice and broccoli for a complete meal.",
